      "blocks": {
        "question_zVJptn": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Will a watch winder work with my watch?",
            "answer": "<p>Watch winders are intended for compatible automatic watches. Check your movement manufacturer's guidance, including rotation direction and turns per day, alongside the specifications of your chosen winder.</p>",
            "open_on_load": false
          }
        },
        "question_i348QJ": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How many watch spaces should I choose?",
            "answer": "<p>Consider the automatic watches you rotate between, the space available at home and whether your collection may grow. Compare each model's capacity, cushion fit and dimensions before ordering.</p>",
            "open_on_load": false
          }
        },
        "question_LYWb6N": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Which rotation settings should I use?",
            "answer": "<p>Settings depend on the movement inside your watch. Follow the watch manufacturer's recommendations and select a winder that supports the required rotation direction and turns per day.</p>",
            "open_on_load": false
          }
        },
        "question_VWEcdH": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I keep my watch winder in the bedroom?",
            "answer": "<p>Operating sound varies by model and environment. Review the product's motor information and contact us if quiet operation is a priority for you.</p>",
            "open_on_load": false
          }
        },
        "question_KYQDFR": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Where can I find shipping and return information?",
